  "description": "UVEDOP crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group C m c 21. Reported CIF formula moiety: C44 H99 Ce3 O11. From the CIF bond table, Ce1 (Ce) has 6 O neighbors; Ce2 (Ce) has 6 O neighbors; Ce1A (Ce) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.705-3.756 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 93.78-103.88°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Ce3(μ3-O^tBu)2(μ-O^tBu)3(O^tBu)6].",
